            │     ├─ filter (&& (&& (== |date_dim_1.d_year| 2002) (<= 4 |date_dim_1.d_moy|)) (<= |date_dim_1.d_moy| (+ 4 3))) (rows≈2 cost≈240)
            │     │  └─ source date_dim AS date_dim_1 row-groups (&& (&& (<= 4 |date_dim_1.d_moy|) (<= |date_dim_1.d_moy| (+ 4 3))) (== |date_dim_1.d_year| 2002)) (rows≈10 cost≈120)
